USER A (CALLER)                                    USER B (RECEIVER)

1. Create RTCPeerConnection
2. Add my camera stream to connection
3. Create OFFER (SDP)
4. Set OFFER as LOCAL description
5. Send OFFER via Socket.IO ────────────→         6. Receive OFFER
                                                   7. Create RTCPeerConnection
                                                   8. Add my camera stream
                                                   9. Set OFFER as REMOTE description
                                                   10. Create ANSWER (SDP)
                                                   11. Set ANSWER as LOCAL description
12. Receive ANSWER ←────────────────────────────  12. Send ANSWER via Socket.IO
13. Set ANSWER as REMOTE description
                                
14. Both exchange ICE candidates (network paths)
                                
15. CONNECTION ESTABLISHED! Video flows directly A ↔ B